In France, walking into a shop WITHOUT saying this is rude 😳🇫🇷

• bonjour = hello (say it first!)
• bonne journée = have a nice day
• bonne soirée = have a nice evening
• poli = polite
• au revoir = goodbye

💌 Save this before your next trip to France
👯 Send it to someone who is visiting France

Small steps. Big dreams ✨

